The {{Term/Store|Radiant Attire||Series, TotK}},{{Exp Game|TotK}}<ref name="TotK Nanna"/> also known as the {{Term/Store|Radiant Set||BotW}},{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref name="CaC 180"/> is a recurring [[Armor Set]] in {{TLoZ Series}}. The Radiant Attire goes unnamed in {{AoC}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Radiant Set is an [[Armor Set]] consisting of the [[Radiant Mask]], [[Radiant Shirt]], and [[Radiant Tights]]. All three pieces can be bought at the [[Gerudo Secret Club]] in [[Gerudo Town]] for 2400 [[Rupee]]s and 9 [[Luminous Stone]]s in total after "[[The Secret Club's Secret]]" [[Side Quest]] has been completed. Painted using Hateno Dye made from crushed Luminous Stones, the Radiant Set's skeletal markings glow when worn at night.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="BotW Inventory 2"/><ref name="BotW Inventory 3"/> The Radiant Set can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] and can be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

If all three pieces of the set have been upgraded twice at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]], wearing the set grants a "Disguise" [[Set Bonus]] against [[Stalkoblin]]s, [[Stalmoblin]]s, and [[Stalizalfos]]. The upgraded set also provides a "Bone Atk. Up" bonus, increasing attack power when wielding [[Weapon]]s made of bone.

